{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2022-11-15 05:30:00', 'title': "MEDTRONIC LAUNCHES WORLD'S FIRST AND ONLY INFUSION SET FOR INSULIN PUMPS THAT DOUBLES WEAR TIME UP TO 7 DAYS IN U.S.", 'text': 'ANNUAL COSTS SAVINGS OF INSULIN OF UP TO 25% AND PLASTIC WASTE REDUCTION OF UP TO 50% WITH MEDTRONIC EXTENDED INFUSION SET DUBLIN , NOV. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE:MDT), A GLOBAL LEADER IN HEALTHCARE TECHNOLOGY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE U.S. LAUNCH OF MEDTRONIC EXTENDED INFUSION SET, THE FIRST AND ONLY INFUSION SET LABELLED FOR UP TO 7-DAY WEAR. AN INFUSION SET IS TUBING THAT DELIVERS INSULIN FROM AN INSULIN PUMP TO THE BODY AND TYPICALLY REQUIRES A SET CHANGE EVERY TWO TO THREE DAYS.'}